      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Viktor Petrovich arrives at work in a cast. Louis is shocked. Meanwhile, Fedya is boiling his leather belt, and the smell is terrible. Let's listen closely to their exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
