    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's review the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Что случилось?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened?' Seeing Chef Barinov hobble into the kitchen with a cane, Louis asks what happened to him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Кто бы говорил про инвалидов.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're one to talk about cripples.' Before Viktor can answer, Senya cracks a joke about the chef calling the staff 'cripples'. Then Viktor replies.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я на больничном.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am on sick leave.' Viktor announces that he is officially on sick leave today.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Меня нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not here.' He tells the crew to pretend he is not even here.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Вы травите тараканов?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you fumigating cockroaches?' Holding his nose, Louis asks if someone is fumigating cockroaches in the kitchen.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "В зале стоит вонь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is a stink in the dining room.' He complains that a terrible stench is drifting out into the dining room.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Это Федя готовит завтрак.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is Fedya making breakfast.' Senya grins and explains that Fedya is just making his 'breakfast'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Он варит ремень.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is boiling a belt.' He reveals that Fedya is boiling a leather belt in a pot. Viktor answers straight away.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Зачем он варит ремень?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why is he boiling a belt?' Barinov stares in disbelief and asks why on earth Fedya is boiling a belt.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Он поспорил на деньги.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He made a bet for money.' Senya explains that they made a five-thousand-ruble bet.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вы как дети.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are like children.' Viktor shakes his head and says his cooks behave like little children.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Идите работать!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
